Subject: [PATCH] clk: ingenic: add the X1600 clock controller
Upstream-Status: Pending

Register the X1600 PLLs, clock muxes, dividers and peripheral gates with
their binding IDs and build configuration. Include SFC and DTRNG clocks,
the AES and SADC gates, and RTC mux handling.

Coordinate CPU and L2 divider updates through custom CPU clock operations
and determine_rate so their rates remain coupled when changing CPU speed.

